        <mxCell id="i28__r5__c1" value="[FIXED] Multi-head self-attention engine (D = 768, 12 heads of 64, INT8, assumed). After START its own controller requests contiguous chunks (X, then Wq, Wk, Wv in three 768 x 256 chunks each) from DRAM through a read-only DMA, runs the tile GEMM core and the softmax unit, and reports DONE or ERR in its status register. v0 is sequential: load, then compute. Expanded on page 02." style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;overflow=hidden;pointerEvents=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="i28__r5" vlsit_native_table="1">
