        <mxCell id="i46__r7__c1" value="[EXISTS] Minh's INT8 tile GEMM (32 x 32 tile). The A operand (activation) comes from its internal A buffer, the B operand (weight chunk) from bram_pp; outer-product, accumulate and load stages overlap at about 33 cycles per tile pair. Only one output tile is accumulated at a time, so k is the innermost loop. Expanded on page 03_LEVEL_3_GEMM." style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;overflow=hidden;pointerEvents=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="i46__r7" vlsit_native_table="1">
